{"title":"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/3/ec3d5bfa725375d72546b62925614d320a33958e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8:45am$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" />, Aisha starts a movie that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes long. If she watches the movie all the way through without a pause or a break, at what time will it finish?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/8/bd8fb8bc5173f83cf6ac416db24410125ee9db99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10:30 \\text{ a.m.} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 11:15 \\text{ a.m.} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 11:30 \\text{ a.m.}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 10:50 \\text{ a.m.}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 10:45 \\text{ a.m.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"748\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Starting at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/3/ec3d5bfa725375d72546b62925614d320a33958e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8:45am$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" /> and moving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes forwards will give us our result. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hours forward is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/2/a52d7bdb1ef77d65ae23eebcb3910fb21298db1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10:45am$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />, and then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> minutes forwards is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/8/0c824f535b415cf0b262499f495582be6ba16324.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 11:30 \\text{ a.m.}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"137\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~any1sgame\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a